<view class="shelf-page"><view class="shelf-eyebrow">YOUR PERSONAL FLIGHT ATLAS</view><view class="shelf-heading"><view class="shelf-title">把喜欢，收进收藏。</view><navigator url="/pages/checkin/index" class="checkin-button {{checkinDone?'checkin-done':''}}" aria-label="{{checkinLabel}}，打开累计签到"><view class="calendar-icon"><text wx:if="{{checkinDone}}">✓</text><view wx:else class="calendar-dot"/></view><text>{{checkinLabel}}</text><view wx:if="{{hasReward}}" class="reward-dot"/></navigator></view><view class="shelf-description">收集配色与印章，珍藏旅途中的更多可能。</view><view class="shelf-section"><view class="section-heading">收藏册</view><view class="shelf-grid"><navigator url="/pages/collection/palettes" class="album-entry" role="button" aria-label="打开海报配色收藏册"><view class="book palette-book"><view class="binding"/><view class="cover-top">FLIGHT ATLAS</view><view class="cover-title">海报配色</view><view class="cover-map"><image src="/assets/collection/palettes.jpg" mode="scaleToFill"/></view><view class="cover-bottom">PALETTE COLLECTION</view></view><view class="album-title">海报配色 <text>›</text></view><view class="album-note">{{paletteCount}} / {{total}} 款</view><view class="album-progress"><view style="width:{{paletteCount/total*100}}%"/></view></navigator><navigator url="/stamps0/pages/index" class="album-entry" role="button" aria-label="打开旅途印章收藏册"><view class="book stamp-book"><view class="binding"/><view class="cover-top">FLIGHT ATLAS</view><view class="cover-title">旅途印章</view><view class="cover-stamp"><image src="/assets/collection/stamps.jpg" mode="scaleToFill"/></view><view class="cover-bottom">TRAVEL STAMPS</view></view><view class="album-title">旅途印章 <text>›</text></view><view class="album-note">{{stampCount}} / 100 枚</view><view class="album-progress"><view style="width:{{stampCount}}%"/></view></navigator><view class="album-entry pending" aria-label="尚未开放的收藏册"><view class="book pending-book"><view class="binding"/></view></view></view></view></view>
